# Review And Closeout

Reviews prioritize behavioral bugs, regressions, missing evidence, security,
compliance, and architecture drift. Findings come before summaries.

Closeout must include:

- what changed;
- quality evidence;
- review status or residual risk;
- docs updated or reason none were needed;
- memory writeback status when durable learning occurred;
- active plugin versions for generated reports or formal artifacts.

Do not close a task as done when required evidence is missing. In observe mode,
report the gap without blocking. In enforced mode, missing required evidence blocks.
